        "text_f7Jkzh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As Oceans Optics continues to grow, so will our network of reefs around the world.</p><p> We already have some feelers in the water for where the next reef will take place, and currently, Panama is looking like a prime candidate! We’ve connected with an incredible coral movement there that’s doing amazing reef-building work, and we can’t wait to collaborate.</p>"
